# Kotlin / Spring Boot

## Layout

```
src/main/kotlin/com/watchmetrics/
  WatchmetricsApplication.kt
  web/          # @Controller — Thymeleaf views
  service/      # business logic
  client/       # external API clients (IMDb, RT, Metacritic)
  model/        # domain types
```

## Patterns

- Use `@Controller` + Thymeleaf for pages; reserve `@RestController` for HTMX fragment endpoints or JSON APIs
- Constructor injection only; no field `@Autowired`
- Data classes for immutable domain models
- Configuration via `application.yml`; secrets via environment variables

## Example controller

```kotlin
@Controller
class SeriesController(private val seriesService: SeriesService) {

    @GetMapping("/series/{id}")
    fun show(@PathVariable id: String, model: Model): String {
        model.addAttribute("series", seriesService.findById(id))
        return "series/detail"
    }
}
```
